VERSION 0.7
FIELDS x y z intensity
SIZE 4 4 4 4
TYPE F F F F
COUNT 1 1 1 1
WIDTH 8
HEIGHT 1
VIEWPOINT 0 0 0 1 0 0 0
POINTS 8
DATA binary
